    <string name="stack_show">Show all</string>
    <string name="stack_hide">Hide</string>
    <string name="stack_explain">Notifications from the same topic fold into one stack, in the app\'s list and in the phone\'s notification shade. Tap a stack in the list to open it. Swiping a notification or stack away only hides it on this phone; clear it in the app to clear it everywhere.</string>
